AUDIO: 'that\'s it. And you don\'t need anything else. Just make sure that that\'s in the prompt because otherwise it might kind of attach it to the character. And uh she or he is in like an interior setting and there\'s like no background noise,'

[01:58] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'that\'s the best one. So, for that, you just kind of say that the background seems like the interior of a shop or interior of a I don\'t know, like a room or something. You can maybe, if you want, you can maybe even prompt'

