VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'in like clear audio, but that\'s not like super necessary. It\'s It\'s It\'s not needed. And what you can see here is that I had pretty much very close frames. And this is the only thing where I had to describe him meanly. Like,'

[02:24] [scene:talk]
